Do not attempt to implement every advanced feature at once. Complete and test the core journey before expanding.

### 21. DEFINITION OF DONE

The application is not complete merely because the pages look attractive.

Demonstrate that:
- A new user can select a language and create an account.
- The age-assurance process works and has an accessible alternative.
- The user can create and edit a profile.
- The user can discover another eligible user and send a connection request.
- Two consenting users can establish a real voice or video call.
- The AI companion can hold a real conversation in supported languages.
- Blocking and reporting work across the relevant user flows.
- Consent and privacy preferences persist.
- The interface works on small mobile screens and supports larger text.
- Sensitive endpoints enforce authorisation server-side.
- Failures show understandable recovery steps.
- No production feature falsely reports success when it has failed.
- Automated tests cover critical authentication, permissions, matching, call, billing, and safety flows.
- Deployment, configuration, limitations, and operating instructions are documented.

